# App-authored transition, not from a tape. No tape or manual in the library
# reaches Focus 42. The only descriptive footing is the public I-There label
# and an unverified secondary overview; this body labels that footing and
# prescribes neither distance, imagery nor presence.

@segment    climb-f35-f42
@title      Climb — Focus 35 to Focus 42
@levels     F42
@from       F35
@fixed
@verbosity  3
@protected  Focus 42, I-There
@duration   ~1m35s

say From Focus 35, you will move through the count to Focus 42.
pause 4
say The available secondary map associates Focus 42 with the solar system, our galaxy, and what it calls our I-There. No tape or manual here establishes what this movement should feel or look like.
pause 7
say Carry those as coordinates, not requirements. Let the numbers mark the movement, and observe what is actually present.
pause 6
level F42
say Thirty-five.
pause 5
say Thirty-six.
pause 5
say Thirty-seven.
pause 5
say Thirty-eight.
pause 5
say Thirty-nine.
pause 5
say Forty.
pause 5
say Forty-one.
pause 5
say Forty-two.
pause 4
say Focus 42. I-There.
pause 8
